{"seq":3,"slug":"building-physics-and-environment","title":"建筑物理与环境控制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/architecture/building-technology/building-physics-and-environment","wordCount":1366,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"建筑物理与环境控制\">建筑物理与环境控制</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>走进一间好房子，你会立刻感到舒适，却很难说清为什么——冬天不冷、夏天不闷、白天不用开灯、隔壁说话听不清。这种&quot;说不清的舒适&quot;恰恰是建筑物理在背后默默工作的结果。这一课要把这些看不见的舒适拆开来看：建筑如何调控热、光、声，让人在室内过得安稳。</p>\n<p>核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>建筑围护结构（墙、屋顶、窗）的核心任务是<strong>控制热量的进出</strong>，关键指标是传热系数。</li>\n<li><strong>被动式设计</strong>优先：用朝向、遮阳、保温、自然通风等不耗能的手段先把舒适做到位，再考虑空调供暖。</li>\n<li><strong>采光</strong>讲究让自然光进入又不刺眼不过热，朝向与遮阳是关键。</li>\n<li><strong>隔声</strong>分隔空气声（说话）和撞击声（脚步），处理手段不同。</li>\n<li>这一切最终服务于<strong>能耗与碳排放</strong>的降低，是连接技术与可持续的桥梁。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><p><strong>热：保温与传热。</strong> 冬天室内热量会穿过墙壁向外跑，跑得多快取决于围护结构的<strong>传热系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（单位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>W/(m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>K)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{W/(m}^2\\cdot\\text{K)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">W/(m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K)</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 值越小，保温越好。通过一面墙的稳态传热量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = U \\cdot A \\cdot \\Delta T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是面积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是室内外温差。要让房子省能，就要降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>（加厚保温层、用中空玻璃）。但窗户是个两难：玻璃 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 值高、保温差，可它又是采光和得热的来源——这正是建筑物理里反复出现的&quot;权衡&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>被动式优先原则。</strong> 与其先盖个保温很差的盒子再用大功率空调硬撑，不如先用&quot;不花钱的物理&quot;把舒适做对：建筑朝向让主要房间朝南（北半球）以获得冬季阳光；夏季用挑檐、遮阳板挡住高角度的烈日；利用热压和风压组织<strong>自然通风</strong>带走余热；用厚重墙体的<strong>热惰性</strong>削平昼夜温差。把这些被动手段用足，再上设备，能耗会大幅下降。</p>\n<p><strong>光：要亮，不要晃。</strong> 自然采光的目标是均匀、柔和、不眩光。南向窗得光多但夏季易过热，需要水平遮阳；东西向的低角度阳光最刺眼也最难遮，常用垂直遮阳或减少开窗。设计时既看采光是否充足（采光系数），也看会不会因为直射光造成眩光与过热。</p>\n<p><strong>声：隔与吸。</strong> 噪声控制有两条线：一是<strong>隔声</strong>，阻止声音穿墙而过——空气声靠墙体质量与密封（越重越密越隔得住），撞击声（楼上脚步）靠楼板浮筑层与弹性垫层切断振动传递；二是<strong>吸声</strong>，在房间内用多孔材料、穿孔板吸收回声，让音乐厅余音恰到好处、让开放办公室不嘈杂。</p>\n<p>各环境要素的设计抓手：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>被动手段</th>\n<th>主动手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热</td>\n<td>传热系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>保温、朝向、遮阳、蓄热</td>\n<td>供暖、空调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光</td>\n<td>采光系数、眩光</td>\n<td>窗位、遮阳、导光</td>\n<td>人工照明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声</td>\n<td>隔声量、混响时间</td>\n<td>墙体质量、隔振、吸声材料</td>\n<td>主动降噪(少见)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风</td>\n<td>换气次数</td>\n<td>开窗位置、热压通风</td>\n<td>机械通风</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[舒适与节能目标] --&gt; B[被动式优先]&#10;  B --&gt; C[朝向与体形]&#10;  B --&gt; D[保温与遮阳]&#10;  B --&gt; E[自然通风与采光]&#10;  A --&gt; F[主动设备补足]&#10;  F --&gt; G[供暖/空调/照明/新风]&#10;  B -.大幅降低.-&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[舒适与节能目标] --&gt; B[被动式优先]\n  B --&gt; C[朝向与体形]\n  B --&gt; D[保温与遮阳]\n  B --&gt; E[自然通风与采光]\n  A --&gt; F[主动设备补足]\n  F --&gt; G[供暖/空调/照明/新风]\n  B -.大幅降低.-&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>同样朝向的两个房间，一个用单层玻璃、一个用中空双层玻璃，冬天哪个更省暖气？用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = U A \\Delta T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 解释（提示：双玻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 值更小）。</li>\n<li>为什么南向窗适合用&quot;水平挑檐&quot;遮阳，而西向窗这一招却不太管用？画一画夏季正午与傍晚太阳的高度角。</li>\n<li>楼上邻居走路的&quot;咚咚&quot;声属于空气声还是撞击声？该用加重墙体还是楼板浮筑层来解决？</li>\n<li>&quot;被动式优先&quot;为什么在节能上往往比&quot;上更高效的空调&quot;更划算？从全生命周期的角度想一想。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>体会建筑物理最好的实验室就是你自己的家：哪个房间夏天最热（多半西晒)？哪扇窗冬天结露（保温差)？哪面墙隔不住邻居的电视声？带着这些观察去读原理，会格外清晰。</li>\n<li>了解&quot;被动房（Passive House）&quot;标准，它把保温、气密、无热桥、新风热回收做到极致，是被动式设计的标杆体系。</li>\n<li>关注超低能耗建筑与近零碳建筑的实践，它们正是把这一课的物理原理推到极致，与第四章的绿色建筑直接接轨。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>建筑物理研究的是&quot;看不见的舒适&quot;：通过控制热（传热系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>、保温与遮阳）、光（采光与防眩）、声（隔声与吸声），让室内冬暖夏凉、明亮安静。核心方法论是<strong>被动式优先</strong>——先用朝向、保温、遮阳、通风这些不耗能的手段把舒适做对，再让设备做补充，能耗自然大降。</p>\n<p>这一课同时也是一座桥：它把单体建筑的技术细节，引向了下一章更宏大的议题——当无数栋这样的建筑聚成城市、当减碳成为全球责任，设计该如何回应？我们进入第四章：城市与可持续建筑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"建筑物理与环境控制","id":"建筑物理与环境控制"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"建筑材料","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/architecture/building-technology/building-materials"},"next":{"title":"城市设计与城市形态","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/architecture/urban-and-sustainability/urban-design-and-form"}}